<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft to build India Internet network.</title>
<headline>Datacraft to build India Internet network.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer network systems company Datacraft Asia said on Monday its unit Datacraft RPG won a Singapore $1.8 million contract with Indian telecommunications firm Videsh Sanchar Nigam Ltd to build an Indian Internet network.</p>
<p>The network would be used to facilitate Internet access in India's major cities, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
